plant and 5 big pumpkins. That sounds manageable right? Well, I finally ended up freezing quite a bit of cooked pumpkin and found myself searching for more and more ways to use it.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I found we liked curried pumpkin soup with toasted hazelnuts and creme fraiche quite a bit but for the most part, we&#39;re not big pumpkin pie or pumpkin pie spice fans. We like our pumpkin on the savory side.</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jlfaeegm":{"crop":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":4032,"height":3024},"alt":"Bacon Pumpkin Lasagna","width":4032,"height":3024,"uri":"577c92_3da3777319c14953b78e550457c53092~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg","name":"20180120_192341.jpg","containerId":"comp-jlfaeegm","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_3da3777319c14953b78e550457c53092~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_450,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20180120_192341.jpg","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_3da3777319c14953b78e550457c53092~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_450,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20180120_192341.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_3da3777319c14953b78e550457c53092~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_900,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/20180120_192341.jpg 2x","css":{"container":{"position":"relative"},"img":{"width":600,"height":450,"objectFit":"cover"}}},"containerWidth":600,"containerHeight"